<title>SWITZERLAND: Kuehne values Dupont deal at $100 mln.</title>
<headline>Kuehne values Dupont deal at $100 mln.</headline>
<dateline>SCHINDELLEGI, Switzerland 1997-08-06</dateline>
<text>
<p>Swiss freight forwarder Kuehne &amp; Nagel International AG said a distribution agreement signed with U.S. chemical and energy company DuPont Co. was worth $100 million.</p>
<p>Earlier today Kuehne &amp; Nagel said had signed an agreement with DuPont Co. that covers its annual freight volume of around one million tonnes.</p>
<p>A Kuehne &amp; Nagel spokesman told Reuters the value of this deal was $100 million.</p>
<p>The deal covers DuPont's distribution activites in Europe, the Middle East and Africa.</p>
<p>-- Zurich Editorial +41 1 631 7340</p>
</text>
